    {
      "id": "P_h9OIN-x9PLGa_wOaIfZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1084.7748907529026,
      "y": 5836.3172938842945,
      "width": 970.2190706989221,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 507969278,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 1583617634,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786364918030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The inject_memory.sh script is updated to read Mermaid files and wrap them in a Markdown code\nblock so the LLM recognizes the syntax.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The inject_memory.sh script is updated to read Mermaid files and wrap them in a Markdown code block so the LLM recognizes the syntax.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wwH2rYQ1qJh5on2PR1Dk7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1089.270141423269,
      "y": 5933.361742589487,
      "width": 1213.858642578125,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 423060962,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 550447550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786364925758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#!/bin/bash\n# .claude/hooks/inject_memory.sh\n\nINPUT=$(cat)\nPROMPT=$(echo \"$INPUT\" | jq -r '.prompt')\nMANIFEST=\"./.ai-memory/manifest.json\"\n\n# --- Cheap route lookup (using jq to find best match) ---\nMATCHED_FILE=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | \\\n  jq -R --slurpfile manifest \"$MANIFEST\" '\n    $manifest[0].routes | map(select(.keywords as $k | $k | any(IN(input)))) | sort_by(.priority) | reverse | .[0].file // empty\n  ' | tr -d '\"')\n\n# --- If no match, fallback to injecting the overview diagram ---\nif [ -z \"$MATCHED_FILE\" ]; then\n  MATCHED_FILE=\"diagrams/api/overview.mmd\"\nfi\n\n# --- Read the specific Mermaid file ---\nDIAGRAM_CONTENT=$(cat \"./.ai-memory/$MATCHED_FILE\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n# --- If we have content, inject it as a Mermaid block ---\nif [ ! -z \"$DIAGRAM_CONTENT\" ]; then\n  INJECTED=\"<relevant_system_maps>\\n\\`\\`\\`mermaid\\n$DIAGRAM_CONTENT\\n\\`\\`\\`\\n</relevant_system_maps>\"\n  echo \"{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"allow\\\",\\\"additionalContext\\\":\\\"$INJECTED\\\"}\"\nelse\n  echo \"{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"allow\\\"}\"\nfi",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "#!/bin/bash\n# .claude/hooks/inject_memory.sh\n\nINPUT=$(cat)\nPROMPT=$(echo \"$INPUT\" | jq -r '.prompt')\nMANIFEST=\"./.ai-memory/manifest.json\"\n\n# --- Cheap route lookup (using jq to find best match) ---\nMATCHED_FILE=$(echo \"$PROMPT\" | \\\n  jq -R --slurpfile manifest \"$MANIFEST\" '\n    $manifest[0].routes | map(select(.keywords as $k | $k | any(IN(input)))) | sort_by(.priority) | reverse | .[0].file // empty\n  ' | tr -d '\"')\n\n# --- If no match, fallback to injecting the overview diagram ---\nif [ -z \"$MATCHED_FILE\" ]; then\n  MATCHED_FILE=\"diagrams/api/overview.mmd\"\nfi\n\n# --- Read the specific Mermaid file ---\nDIAGRAM_CONTENT=$(cat \"./.ai-memory/$MATCHED_FILE\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n# --- If we have content, inject it as a Mermaid block ---\nif [ ! -z \"$DIAGRAM_CONTENT\" ]; then\n  INJECTED=\"<relevant_system_maps>\\n\\`\\`\\`mermaid\\n$DIAGRAM_CONTENT\\n\\`\\`\\`\\n</relevant_system_maps>\"\n  echo \"{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"allow\\\",\\\"additionalContext\\\":\\\"$INJECTED\\\"}\"\nelse\n  echo \"{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"allow\\\"}\"\nfi",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xJXad8EnZ3qXJ-sTUcgnU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1094.5700922360556,
      "y": 6678.253795483831,
      "width": 1364.4227098424801,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1140724834,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1797935586,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786364954164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What happens to the LLM:\nThe LLM receives the raw Mermaid text in its context. Because modern LLMs (Claude 3.5/4, GPT-4) are natively trained on Mermaid, it\nunderstands the visual structure perfectly. It can trace flowchart TD paths or parse mindmap hierarchies to answer questions like \"What\nhappens after a charge succeeds?\" without guessing.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What happens to the LLM:\nThe LLM receives the raw Mermaid text in its context. Because modern LLMs (Claude 3.5/4, GPT-4) are natively trained on Mermaid, it understands the visual structure perfectly. It can trace flowchart TD paths or parse mindmap hierarchies to answer questions like \"What happens after a charge succeeds?\" without guessing.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
