      "seed": 2100303074,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 807716642,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786365049854,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The beauty of Mermaid is that it's just text. The post-tool hook can append a new node to the relevant diagram.\n\nScript: .claude/hooks/update_diagram.sh (runs after a successful fix)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The beauty of Mermaid is that it's just text. The post-tool hook can append a new node to the relevant diagram.\n\nScript: .claude/hooks/update_diagram.sh (runs after a successful fix)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VGJe47IzEqftz5KTq3H5I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1078.4526297903458,
      "y": 7119.493110371881,
      "width": 1030.4990234375,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 443403390,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 500830690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786365056814,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#!/bin/bash\n# Extract the error that was fixed\nLAST_ERROR=$(cat /tmp/last_error_signature.txt)\n\n# Determine which diagram to update (debug playbook usually)\nDIAGRAM=\"./.ai-memory/diagrams/debug/playbook.mmd\"\n\n# Append a new error -> fix path to the flowchart\n# We use `sed` to insert a new node and edge before the closing \"```mermaid\"\nNEW_NODE=\"    $NEW_ERROR[$LAST_ERROR] --> |Fix| $NEW_SOLUTION[Apply $SOLUTION_NAME]\"\nsed -i \"/^```mermaid/a $NEW_NODE\" \"$DIAGRAM\"\n\n# Also update the manifest to include the new error signature\njq --arg err \"$LAST_ERROR\" '.routes += [{\"keywords\": [$err], \"file\": \"diagrams/debug/playbook.mmd\"}]' \\\n  ./.ai-memory/manifest.json > tmp.json && mv tmp.json ./.ai-memory/manifest.json",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "#!/bin/bash\n# Extract the error that was fixed\nLAST_ERROR=$(cat /tmp/last_error_signature.txt)\n\n# Determine which diagram to update (debug playbook usually)\nDIAGRAM=\"./.ai-memory/diagrams/debug/playbook.mmd\"\n\n# Append a new error -> fix path to the flowchart\n# We use `sed` to insert a new node and edge before the closing \"```mermaid\"\nNEW_NODE=\"    $NEW_ERROR[$LAST_ERROR] --> |Fix| $NEW_SOLUTION[Apply $SOLUTION_NAME]\"\nsed -i \"/^```mermaid/a $NEW_NODE\" \"$DIAGRAM\"\n\n# Also update the manifest to include the new error signature\njq --arg err \"$LAST_ERROR\" '.routes += [{\"keywords\": [$err], \"file\": \"diagrams/debug/playbook.mmd\"}]' \\\n  ./.ai-memory/manifest.json > tmp.json && mv tmp.json ./.ai-memory/manifest.json",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D-pFBzRsvsX5-cV6-J-i4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1082.4587499942418,
      "y": 7566.288568220858,
      "width": 1140.6699347203362,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2037515554,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 2070381282,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786365074330,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Result: Over time, your playbook.mmd grows organically.\nBefore: Segfault -> Check Docker.\nAfter 3 months: Segfault -> Check Docker -> Check ulimit -> Check memory_limit -> Check kernel version. The\ndiagram becomes the definitive, crowd-sourced troubleshooting Bible for the repo.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Result: Over time, your playbook.mmd grows organically.\nBefore: Segfault -> Check Docker.\nAfter 3 months: Segfault -> Check Docker -> Check ulimit -> Check memory_limit -> Check kernel version. The diagram becomes the definitive, crowd-sourced troubleshooting Bible for the repo.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OIb1aTtHPtx5RfzV1EErS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1080.3595664275595,
      "y": 7773.765787390295,
      "width": 610.416259765625,
